# Dispatch with metalcraft: "Tap target creature. Metalcraft — If you control three or more artifacts, exile that
# creature" (CR 701.26a, 608.2c). Three Moxen are the three artifacts, so the Elite Vanguard are tapped and then exiled
# by the same resolution (CR 608.2h reads the count as it resolves).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Dispatch
Plains
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Elite Vanguard
Plains x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Elite Vanguard.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dispatch.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Elite Vanguard)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Exile.Elite Vanguard.Power = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 1
